---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms — DekhoYahan"
  description="Simple terms for using DekhoYahan."
>
  <article class="terms">
    <header class="terms-hero shell">
      <p class="terms-kicker">TERMS</p>

      <h1 class="terms-title">A few simple ground rules.</h1>

      <div class="terms-intro">
        <p>
          DekhoYahan exists to help people understand technology and the
          world around them more clearly. You're welcome to explore the site
          and share links to things you find useful.
        </p>

        <p>
          By using DekhoYahan, you agree to these terms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="terms-body shell">
      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>Using DekhoYahan</h2>

        <p>
          You may browse DekhoYahan and share links to our pages and
          explanations.
        </p>

        <p>
          Please do not misuse the site, interfere with its operation or
          security, attempt to gain unauthorized access, or use it in ways
          that harm other people or systems.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>Our content</h2>

        <p>
          Unless we say otherwise, the original writing, illustrations,
          visuals, interactions, branding, and other content we create for
          DekhoYahan is our original work and is protected by applicable
          intellectual property laws.
        </p>

        <p>
          You may quote or share small portions when reasonable, provided
          you clearly credit DekhoYahan and, where practical, link back to
          the original page.
        </p>

        <p>
          Please do not copy, reproduce, republish, or distribute
          substantial parts of our original content without permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>Information, not professional advice</h2>

        <p>
          We work to make our explanations useful and responsible, but
          technology and information change, and mistakes are possible.
        </p>

        <p>
          DekhoYahan is provided for general information and understanding.
          Nothing on the site should be treated as legal, medical,
          financial, security, or other professional advice.
        </p>

        <p>
          You should use your own judgment and seek appropriate professional
          advice when a decision requires it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>Ideas you send us</h2>

        <p>
          You may occasionally send us topic suggestions, questions,
          examples, feedback, or other ideas.
        </p>

        <p>
          Sending something does not guarantee that we will use or publish
          it. If it helps inspire something we create, we may research the
          subject and develop an explanation in our own way.
        </p>

        <p>
          Please do not send us confidential information or material you do
          not have the right to share.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>Other websites</h2>

        <p>
          We may link to other websites or sources when they are useful for
          understanding a topic.
        </p>

        <p>
          We do not control those websites and are not responsible for their
          content, availability, or privacy practices.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>Availability and changes</h2>

        <p>
          DekhoYahan is growing, so explanations, features, and parts of the
          site may be updated, changed, or removed over time.
        </p>

        <p>
          We do not guarantee that the site or every piece of content will
          always be available, complete, current, or error-free.
        </p>

        <p>
          We may also update these terms as DekhoYahan changes. When we do,
          we will update the date on this page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>Questions</h2>

        <p>
          Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@dekhoyahan.com">hello@dekhoyahan.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="terms-meta">Last updated: 19 August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* All rules below are scoped by Astro to this page's own markup only
     (data-astro-cid), and every class is Terms-specific. Values are
     intentionally identical to the approved Privacy document styles
     (.privacy-*) so the two pages read as one visual system — this file
     doesn't touch Privacy, About, or global.css to reuse it. */

  .terms {
    padding: clamp(56px, 8vh, 96px) 0 clamp(84px, 11vh, 132px);
  }

  .terms-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--cobalt);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 720;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .terms-title {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 16ch;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 50px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.16;
    letter-spacing: -0.032em;
  }

  .terms-intro {
    margin: clamp(22px, 3.5vh, 32px) 0 0;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .terms-intro p {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .terms-intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .terms-body {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-top: clamp(48px, 7vh, 72px);
  }

  .terms-section {
    margin-top: clamp(36px, 5.5vh, 52px);
    padding-top: clamp(28px, 4.5vh, 40px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }

  .terms-section:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .terms-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 1.8vw, 23px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .terms-section p {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 16.5px;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .terms-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .terms-section a {
    color: var(--cobalt);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .terms-meta {
    margin: clamp(40px, 6vh, 56px) 0 0;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .terms-title {
      max-width: none;
    }

    .terms-intro p {
      font-size: 16.5px;
    }

    .terms-section {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding-top: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
